  "2031381646": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -88397757,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You must be the one making all this happen. I’ve been waiting to meet you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1446251507": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -932665366,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Himari chose well. I approve… more than you can imagine.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1805316440": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I won’t waste your time. I came here for business.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "637566932": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Your little farm has reached the point where it can no longer be ignored. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2113441400": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "The numbers, the quality… it’s already being whispered about in the right circles.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-303203621": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Those circles are mine. Wealthy, powerful, very discreet. People who desire indulgences the average citizen will never touch.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1087512967": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And your milk… is exactly the sort of indulgence they crave.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-958751246": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Here’s my proposal. One million dollars annually to Kirby and Clay to keep this place running at full capacity for my clients.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1537127909": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    1059571093,
    1983460027,
    1802236452
   ],
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And for you personally… two hundred thousand upfront. Consider it a signing bonus, no questions asked.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1059571093": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1537127909,
   "children": [
    878641059
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That’s… generous. You really believe the milk is worth that much?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1983460027": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1537127909,
   "children": [
    -885930422
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why should I trust you? This sounds too good to be true.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-885930422": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1983460027,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Because I don’t make promises I can’t keep. My wealth is proof enough.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "878641059": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1059571093,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Worth far more. But you’ll see in time just how valuable rarity is.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1802236452": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1537127909,
   "children": [
    1043706205,
    -434755526,
    -1463062673
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "And what if I asked for... more than just money?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1043706205": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1802236452,
   "actor": "HimariMom",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Then perhaps I’d consider adding… personal bonuses. Himari isn’t the only one in my family who enjoys ambition.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1463062673": {
   "kind": "choice",
